; threshold_farmhouse.room - the farmhouse interior (design 04 section 3.2): the laid table on the flat floor
; (cols 6-12, the sword mark of STORY-02) and the hearth (cols 17-18). No gate or puzzle.
; The sword (col 9, legend i) lies on the meal table's planks (bottom centre at 300, 269) until Ivo takes it; Up reaches it
; from the floor in front of or beside the table, x 240 to 368 (STORY-02, systems/pickups). Taking it starts its talk
; (param talk): "...Sorry. I'll need this." (STORY-16, design 05 Ato 2).
; Indoors: wood planks, so no earth turf lip shows; the hearth stays stone; no interior grows grass (systems/grass).

